title: VMware vCenter Server Appliance: Replication
agents: vcsa_health
catalog: app/vmware
license: GPL-2.0-only
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check reports Enhanced Linked Mode replication for a VMware vCenter
 Server Appliance (VCSA), listing the replication partners of each node and
 the availability and reported lag of each partnership. The data is
 retrieved by the special agent {agent_vcsa_health}.

 An unavailable replication partner is {CRIT} by default, configurable via
 the ruleset "VCSA replication".

discovery:
 One service is created only on appliances that have at least one
 replication partner. Standalone embedded deployments get no service.
